      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Steppers driving what?\n\nFYI, something like https://odriverobotics.com/ can upgrade from the 2-phase NEMA steppers to 3-phase BLDCs w/ encoders doing closed loop field oriented control. Though it _probably_ shouldn't be an issue anyways.",
